Output out.mp4
Set FontSize 32
Set Width 3840
Set Height 2160
Set Theme { "background": "#333538", "foreground": "#FFFFFF", "cursor": "#FFFFFF", "selection": "#4A4D50", "black": "#333538", "white": "#FFFFFF" }
Set TypingSpeed 80ms
Set Margin 40
Set Padding 40

Sleep 1s
Type 'apify actors search "instagram"'
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 7s